<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">reinforced-bandolier</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A heavy-duty bandolier of layered leather and iron clasps,
capable of holding a full complement of potions. The iron
reinforcement offers a sliver of protection without sacrificing
carrying capacity.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 20)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> leather strip (x3), iron ingot (x1),
                 thread spool (x2), bone needle (x1)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Capacity:</ansi>    12 potions

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help tailoring</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
